{
  "id": "PSA.60",
  "number": "60",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 60",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "60",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 60"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Shushan-eduth, Michtam of David, to teach; when he strove with Aram-naharaim and with Aram-zobah, when Joab returned, and smote of Edom in the valley of salt twelve thousand.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O God, thou hast cast us off, thou hast scattered us, thou hast been displeased; O turn thyself to us again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast made the earth to tremble; thou hast broken it: heal the breaches thereof; for it shaketh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast shewed thy people hard things: thou hast made us to drink the wine of astonishment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast given a banner to them that fear thee, that it may be displayed because of the truth. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That thy beloved may be delivered; save",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy right hand, and hear me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God hath spoken in his holiness; I will rejoice, I will divide Shechem, and mete out the valley of Succoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine, and Manasseh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine; Ephraim also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the strength of mine head; Judah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my lawgiver;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my washpot; over Edom will I cast out my shoe: Philistia, triumph thou because of me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who will bring me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "into",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the strong city? who will lead me into Edom?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Wilt",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not thou, O God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hadst cast us off? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thou",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", O God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "didst not go out with our armies?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give us help from trouble: for vain",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the help of man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Through God we shall do valiantly: for he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall tread down our enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.61",
    "number": "61",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
